flowchart LR
    accTitle: Flappy Bird AI neuroevolution loop
    accDescr: Random neural-network weights control birds in simulation. When all birds die, fitness drives selection, crossover, mutation, and elitism before the next simulation.

    A["🧬 Random Weights<br/>(Generation 1)"] --> B["🎮 Simulation<br/>5 inputs → NN → flap?"]
    B --> C{All birds dead?}
    C -->|No| B
    C -->|Yes| D["📊 Evaluate Fitness<br/>(survival frames)"]
    D --> E["✂️ Select Top 5%<br/>Crossover + Mutate"]
    E --> F["👑 Elitism<br/>(best brain untouched)"]
    F --> B
